From 3ba11106c5a703b5b8e9cfa6cc8395fce79ae28e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Code Review <review@local>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 15:02:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Close the skill loop and enforce the application pipeline

Skill loop (Prepare <-> Advance):
- Schema: resume_profiles.skills (confirmed skills), learning_items.skill_tags
  + status (pending/done); learning_items.url now nullable for gap-generated
  items. Migration 0012 + snapshot.
- ai.skillGap: matching skills merge into the profile; missing skills become
  tracked learning items (deduped) instead of evaporating
- learning.add: AI now also extracts skill tags from the fetched page content
- learning.setStatus: marking a resource learned merges its skill tags into
  the profile skills
- jobs.search: profile skills feed relevance scoring, so learning measurably
  improves match quality
- Learning Center UI: To learn / Learned status, skill tag chips, one-click
  'Learned' toggle; Optimizer confirms gaps were saved

Application pipeline:
- ApplicationTransitions map: forward-only moves, terminal offer/rejected
- updateStatus validates transitions and writes an application_events audit
  record per change, so pipeline metrics are trustworthy
- shared/constants.test.ts covers the transition map invariants
